  "description": "The Hareraiser is a 26” wheeled Dirt Jumper (DJ). It is made from trustworthy 100% 4130 chromoly. The frame’s lively feel comes from its ultra-short chainstays and our BMX know-how. You’ll also find integrated chain tensioners, BSA73mm threaded bottom bracket, and a tapered 1-1/8” to 1-1/2” headtube with removable Gyro tabs.\n\nThe complete Hareraiser features a 100% chromoly Hareraiser fork, Fairdale MX-4 bars, and a Sunday Freeze front load stem. This rigid fork can offer a more BMX feel in skateparks, or simply a lower-priced way to get started on a Hareraiser.",
